# ── Personal / generated artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The hero-shot pack: 2x screenshots of the running suite against Jag's OWN data —
# his library, his calendar, his email on screen. Regenerable, ~30 MB of PNGs, and
# personal rather than repo. The published handoff is the shareable form; the docs
# link to that URL, never to this path.
Documentation/Images/

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Native shells (native/) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gradle's own state and the collected APKs. `.gradle-home/` and `.android-home/` are
# the Gradle cache and the DEBUG signing key when built through native/android/build.mjs:
# kept beside the project so a Docker build and a local-SDK build sign staging APKs with the
# same key (an APK signed by a different key cannot install over the last one).
native/android/.gradle/
native/android/.gradle-home/
native/android/.android-home/
native/android/.kotlin/
native/android/out/
native/android/local.properties
native/desktop/out/
# Signing keys never enter the repo. The release keystore lives in ~/.jkos/ (signing.mjs).
*.keystore
*.jks
